    "body": "since there are subtle differences and it's difficult to keep track of them all and remember to update it when things change.\r\n\r\nFixes #7914. The cost is that Cython won't identiy cyfunctions compiled with a different Limited API versions as cyfunctions. Which mostly means it won't do any cyfunc-specific optimizations.",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-25T20:08:37Z",
