            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It looks like `cythonize` is spotting the same file name and caching the `define_macros` somewhere (so they were all being run with `Py_LIMITED_API` set to `0x03090000` which isn't the intent of the test). I'll pick this bit back to 3.2 to fix the test there.",
            "commit_id": "1e6cf8241bbd6abda432a03472e2048c1ff90fca",
            "created_at": "2026-08-23T19:59:54Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -41,20 +42,22 @@ all_extensions = []\n \n for version in range(9, sys.version_info[1]+1):\n     version_hex = f\"0x03{version:02x}0000\"\n+    build_dir = cwd / f\"py3{version}\"\n     extensions = []\n \n     for module in modules:\n+        shutil.copyfile(f\"{module}.pyx\", f\"{module}_{version}.pyx\")",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7916#discussion_r3839458389",
